@startuml sequence_snapshot_at
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Snapshot At Request (existing - Feature 02)

participant Client as C
participant GoalProgressController as Ctrl
participant GetGoalProgressAtHandler as H
database "SQL Server" as DB

C -> Ctrl: GET /at?goalId=17&asOf=2026-03-15T23:59:59Z
Ctrl -> H: send(query)
H -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*)\nFROM Achievements\nWHERE GoalId=17\n  AND ProfileId=...\n  AND RecordedAt <= asOf
DB --> H: count
H --> Ctrl: GoalProgressDto
Ctrl -> Ctrl: cache header per asOf age
Ctrl --> C: 200 OK

@enduml
